00:49:01.200 --> 00:49:02.516
and we'll pepper those things in,

00:49:02.516 --> 00:49:05.693
but there was a hope,
even while I was there,

00:49:06.680 --> 00:49:08.150
there was a hope that
we wouldn't have to use

00:49:08.150 --> 00:49:09.090
any of that stuff.

00:49:09.090 --> 00:49:09.923
That we wouldn't have to resort to--

00:49:09.923 --> 00:49:11.310
It was an insurance policy.

00:49:11.310 --> 00:49:12.553
To directing anybody.

00:49:13.431 --> 00:49:15.560
The only difference in my
mind is that we came up

00:49:15.560 --> 00:49:17.460
with that on the day
that we saw that people

00:49:17.460 --> 00:49:18.960
